  "notable_quotes": [
    "Aromaticity modulation in isomorphic Zn-triazolate-dicarboxylate pillar-layered MOFs enables controllable inverse C2H2/CO2 adsorption and separation.",
    "Inverse separation improves with increasing temperature, and one-step separation of a 50/50 C2H2/CO2 mixture yields C2H2 product with >99.99% purity at room temperature.",
    "Breakthrough tests show Zn-FA-TRZ and Zn-MUC-TRZ follow common C2H2-selective separation, whereas Zn-BDC-TRZ gives prominent CO2-selective inverse C2H2/CO2 separation."
  ],
